{"base_rate":0.7130124777183601,"brier":0.420274688057041,"bss":-1.0538706537267082,"bss_hi":-0.5657781984896467,"bss_lo":-1.9506947804690147,"chart":{"base":[986.5,139.4],"fp":[819.7,374.0],"lead":"62,-100.2 272,-104.2 482,-119.3 692,-155","note":{"base":"skill -1.05 — higher than 1% of cities","fp":"low end +59pp, high end -1pp","lead":"day-1 error 4.5 °C — better than 0% of cities","rel":"promised 2% → rained 62%; promised 94% → rained 91%"},"rel":"76.5,198.4 348.8,127.9 656.4,71.6"},"country":"BA","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve"],"ece":0.425222816399287,"ess":104.41256300891806,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Sarajevo</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Sarajevo rain forecast is cannot beat its own climatology, though 4 points on its probability scale are off by more than chance explains.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (100%), believe about\n<b>98%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(1%), there is still roughly a <b>59%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 561 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-05-31. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nSARAJEVO, 5.7 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score -1.05, ranked 211 of\n213 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(208&ndash;212) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>1%</td><td class='num'><b>59%</b></td><td class='num'>279</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>11%</td><td class='num'><b>79%</b></td><td class='num'>52</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>32%</td><td class='num'><b>71%</b></td><td class='num'>62</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>62%</td><td class='num'><b>87%</b></td><td class='num'>53</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>88%</td><td class='num'><b>82%</b></td><td class='num'>50</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>100%</td><td class='num'><b>98%</b></td><td class='num'>65</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">4 of 6 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Sarajevo</b> <span class=\"muted\">Bosnia and Herzegovina</span></p>\n  <p class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag bad\">Cannot beat climatology</span>\n    <span class=\"muted\">4 points off by more than chance</span></p>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score</dt><dd>-1.05</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>208&ndash;212\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 213</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>561 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Sarajevo &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Sarajevo\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"382\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"58\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">0%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"146.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"146.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"291.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"291.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"146.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">25%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"235.0\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"235.0\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"200.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"200.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"204.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">50%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"323.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"323.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"109.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"109.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"323.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">75%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"113.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">75%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"412\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"412\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">100%</text><polygon class=\"chart-band\" points=\"60.410752688172046,375.47670250896056 96.80384615384615,305.0 170.13806451612902,229.3548387096774 276.47811320754715,114.15094339622641 367.96240000000006,32.56 410.4750769230769,18.0 410.4750769230769,29.19999999999999 367.96240000000006,98.07999999999998 276.47811320754715,203.43396226415095 170.13806451612902,305.6774193548387 96.80384615384615,368.0 60.410752688172046,382.0\" opacity=\"0.16\"/><line class=\"chart-ideal\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,4\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line class=\"chart-base\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"122.46345811051691\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"122.46345811051691\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"60.410752688172046,168.03584229390682 96.80384615384615,95.0 170.13806451612902,123.67741935483872 276.47811320754715,66.07547169811318 367.96240000000006,83.52000000000004 410.4750769230769,23.599999999999966\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 1%&amp;#10;It rained 59% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 279 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"60.410752688172046\" cy=\"168.03584229390682\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 11%&amp;#10;It rained 79% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 52 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"96.80384615384615\" cy=\"95.0\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 32%&amp;#10;It rained 71% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 62 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"170.13806451612902\" cy=\"123.67741935483872\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 62%&amp;#10;It rained 87% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 53 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"276.47811320754715\" cy=\"66.07547169811318\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 88%&amp;#10;It rained 82% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 50 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"367.96240000000006\" cy=\"83.52000000000004\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 100%&amp;#10;It rained 98% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 65 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"410.4750769230769\" cy=\"23.599999999999966\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(71%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\">Not enough days in this city's record to split the year into four and still say anything defensible about each part. The split is shown only where it is supported.</p>\n"},"lat":43.84864,"lon":18.35644,"n":561,"n_cities":213,"name":"Sarajevo","offset_days":-1,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.08,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.006810035842293907,"n":279,"obs":0.5878136200716846,"sig":true},{"hi":0.18,"lo":0.08,"mean":0.1096153846153846,"n":52,"obs":0.7884615384615384,"sig":true},{"hi":0.5100000000000011,"lo":0.18,"mean":0.3167741935483871,"n":62,"obs":0.7096774193548387,"sig":true},{"hi":0.75,"lo":0.5100000000000011,"mean":0.6171698113207548,"n":53,"obs":0.8679245283018868,"sig":true},{"hi":0.98,"lo":0.75,"mean":0.8756000000000002,"n":50,"obs":0.82,"sig":false},{"hi":1.0,"lo":0.98,"mean":0.9956923076923077,"n":65,"obs":0.9846153846153847,"sig":false}],"prcp_km":5.7,"provisional":false,"rank":211,"rank_hi":212.0,"rank_lo":207.975,"reliability":0.23388617894526428,"resolution":0.020158796880961914,"skill_pct":null,"slug":"sarajevo","station":"SARAJEVO","timezone":"Europe/Sarajevo"}